From 808e02da0fe08d8cf45b0719af5b88003548b9a1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TeamHarrisCali <noreply@example.invalid>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 17:49:17 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] nds: add CONFIG_NDS_DSI (16 MB main RAM for DSi mode) and
 Nintendo/DSI product

Widen the ARM9 MPU main-RAM region to 16 MB, move DTCM to 0x02FF0000 (outside the
kernel's RAM, which ends at 0x02FF0000), and add a vendor product that is the DLDI
build with DRAM_SIZE=0x00FF0000. Not for DS or DS-mode boots.
---
 linux-2.6.x/arch/arm/mach-nds/Kconfig   |   14 +
 linux-2.6.x/arch/arm/mach-nds/head.S    |   14 +-
 vendors/Nintendo/DSI/.sgbuilt_user      |    0
 vendors/Nintendo/DSI/Makefile           |  188 ++++
 vendors/Nintendo/DSI/config.arch        |   14 +
 vendors/Nintendo/DSI/config.linux-2.6.x |  849 +++++++++++++++++
 vendors/Nintendo/DSI/config.uClibc      |  144 +++
 vendors/Nintendo/DSI/config.vendor      | 1153 +++++++++++++++++++++++
 vendors/Nintendo/DSI/inittab            |    2 +
 vendors/Nintendo/DSI/issue              |   13 +
 vendors/Nintendo/DSI/rc                 |   33 +
 11 files changed, 2423 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100644 vendors/Nintendo/DSI/.sgbuilt_user
 create mode 100644 vendors/Nintendo/DSI/Makefile
 create mode 100644 vendors/Nintendo/DSI/config.arch
 create mode 100644 vendors/Nintendo/DSI/config.linux-2.6.x
